=2 Walkthrough
* Talk to Hieronymus.
* Travel to the Beastmen Ensign at (G-12) in {z:Grauberg}.
** One can enter solo (very easy at Item Level 119) or use a party.
* Once the party leader has selected to enter, you will be transported into {z:Ruhotz Silvermines}.
* A party of 3 {m:Quadavs|Quadav}, 2 soldiers and 1 caravaneer, will immediately start slowly running towards the exit.
** The Caravaneer continues to run to the exit no matter what, the two soldiers will attack your party.
** Should the Caravaneer make it to the end of the area, which is quite large, the mission is failed.
* Once all three {m:Quadavs|Quadav} are defeated, the Mission Objective is complete.
* You must exit the area by **using the Twilight Aureola** for {n:Hieronymus} to acknowledge the mission as successful!
* Return and talk to Hieronymus for your reward.

=2 Notes
* There seems to be no time limit to how long you can take to get to {z:Ruhotz Silvermines}.
* All 3 of the {m:Quadavs|Quadav} are sleepable by Lullaby or the Sleep spells.
* Repetitive stun/sleep/bind is helpful in this battle.
* The {m:Quadavs|Quadav} are very weak, only having around 2000 HP.

